tmux for Debian / Ubuntu
------------------------

This package provides a standalone, statically-linked build of tmux compiled from
the official tmux-builds project:
https://github.com/tmux/tmux-builds

Features:
- Statically linked with musl libc, libevent, and ncurses.
- Zero dynamic library dependencies.
- Portable across Debian 11 (Bullseye), Debian 12 (Bookworm), Debian 13 (Trixie),
  Debian 14 (Forky), Debian Sid, and Ubuntu 22.04 (Jammy), 24.04 (Noble),
  25.10 (Questing), 26.04 (Resolute).
- Standard installation paths (/usr/bin/tmux and /usr/share/man/man1/tmux.1.gz).

Built with tmux-builder:
https://github.com/tmux-builder/tmux-builder
